#
# No Snort rules remain for this campaign after review.
# The C2 registration beacon rule (POST /api/v1/register) was dropped because
# /api/v1/register is a ubiquitous REST endpoint that would produce extreme
# false-positive volume at strict leniency. Use Suricata DNS rules and Sigma
# behavioral detections instead.
